      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ryan are delighted to bring Teeveeny, Dromina, Co. Cork to the market — a spacious and beautifully maintained 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom detached home, ideally set on a generous c. 0.6 acre site. Offering a wonderful balance of comfort, privacy, and practicality, this property presents an excellent opportunity for families or anyone seeking a peaceful lifestyle in a convenient countryside location.\n\nBuilt in c. 2007, the home extends to approximately 180 sqm and has been well cared for throughout. The layout is bright and spacious, with well-proportioned rooms, ideal for modern family living. A strong C1 BER rating reflects the home's energy efficiency, supported by oil-fired central heating, two stoves, and a back boiler. The home also benefits from a floored attic, providing valuable additional storage space or future potential.\n\nInside, the accommodation includes four generous bedrooms, three bathrooms, and a selection of living spaces designed for both relaxation and entertaining. The interiors are finished to a solid standard, offering a warm and welcoming atmosphere throughout.\n\nOutside, the property continues to impress. The gated entrance opens to a large, well-landscaped garden, featuring mature planting, open lawns, and a patio area ideal for outdoor dining and leisure. A detached garage with loft offers ample storage, a workshop space, or further possibilities depending on your needs.\n\nTeeveeny is located just outside Dromina village, offering a peaceful setting with a strong sense of community, yet remaining within easy reach of Charleville and commuting routes to Cork and Limerick. Local amenities, schools, and shops are just a short drive away, making the location both quiet and convenient.\n\nThis is a well-appointed home in a lovely rural setting, with plenty of space both inside and out. Viewings are highly recommended to fully appreciate all it has to offer.\n\nEntrance 2.1 x 6.1 tiledLiving room 4.3 x 4.9 stove, laminate flooringKitchen/dining room 4.1 x 6.5 tiled, fully fitted units, island, double doors to sideUtility room 4.5 x 3.3 tiled, fitted unitsToilet 1.5 x 1.5 tiledLiving room 3.9 x 4.5 stove system, double doors, laminate flooring1st floor:Bedroom 4.5 x 4.1 double room, laminate flooringBedroom 4.1 x 3.9 built in wardrobes, double room, laminate flooringBathroom 2.4 x 2.9 floor to ceiling tiles, electric shower, jacuzzi bathBedroom 3.2 x 3.9 laminate flooring, double roomBedroom 4.2 x 5.1 built in wardrobes, laminate flooring, double roomEn suite 2.1 x 2.6 floor to ceiling tiles, pump shower\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n• 4 bed 3 bath• Detached home• Set on a generous C. 0.6 acre site• Bio cycle septic tank• Mains water• Expands to C. 180sqm• Built C. 2007• C1 BER Rating• Floored attic• Oil central heating with 2 stoves and back boiler• Gated entrance• Detached garage with loft• Well landscaped garden with patio\n\nThese particulars have been prepared by DNG John Ryan and whilst every care has been taken to ensure that these are accurate and correct, we are not responsible for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, if the property is let, sold or withdrawn from sale or if it is not suitable for your purpose. These particulars are for information only and are given under the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract. Neither whole nor any part of this document or any reference thereto may be included in any public document, circular or statement nor published without the written consent of DNG John Ryan. PSL: 003615"
